            {
                "entry_id": "740aa065-189d-3e8e-8ccb-93eefa260dc1",
                "word": "xian",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "05ff5f59-726b-4c49-9aa1-7b38d8c610e8",
                        "entry_id": "740aa065-189d-3e8e-8ccb-93eefa260dc1",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "xians"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b5a2ed65-f9c7-3075-ac27-06eab6bd6fc3",
                        "entry_id": "740aa065-189d-3e8e-8ccb-93eefa260dc1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An administrative subdivision of imperial, republican, and communist China roughly equivalent to counties, now distinguished from the more urban \\\"districts\\\" (qu). (Alternative form of hsien for Taiwan (ROC).)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "China",
                            "Taiwan"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ec0975c-a39b-44f6-8b6f-be6ff73f3c98",
                                "sense_id": "b5a2ed65-f9c7-3075-ac27-06eab6bd6fc3",
                                "text": "Tight and dense motifs occur on bronzes excavated in 1923 from a tomb at Lijialou at Xinzheng Xian in southern Henan attributed to the small state of Zheng."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf57e6cd-a56b-46db-920f-63eaac9ca8d4",
                                "sense_id": "b5a2ed65-f9c7-3075-ac27-06eab6bd6fc3",
                                "text": "At the time of the elections (1980) Nanjing was subdivided into three suburban counties (xian) and nine urban districts (qu)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8561078e-6338-4f72-ae85-ad54fed5c4c5",
                                "sense_id": "b5a2ed65-f9c7-3075-ac27-06eab6bd6fc3",
                                "text": "The Henan Mongol autonomous county (xian) is inhabited by Tsoros Mongols, and there are Ööld Mongols in the Huzhu autonomous county."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
